      "statement": "D1 (SMCJ24A, LCSC C224045, unidirectional, cathode on /12V_RAW, anode on GND) clamps positive load dumps and inductive transients on /12V_RAW below 38.9 V, under every downstream absolute maximum: Q1 AO4485 40 V, TLE9201SG 40 V, B340A 40 V, VNLD5090 42 V, DRV8825 45 V."
    },
    {
      "checks": [
        "reverse-block"
      ],
      "id": "psu-reverse-block",
      "source": {
        "locator": "pending_requirements/psu-reverse-block/source",
        "path": "block-contract.json"
      },
      "statement": "Q1 (AO4485 P-MOSFET, LCSC C51499; drain pins 5-8 on /12V_RAW, source pins 1-3 on /12V_PROT) with D19 (BZT52C12 gate-source Zener, C43491) and R124 (47k gate pull-down, C25819) blocks reverse battery without a series diode drop."
    },
    {
