      },
      "statement": "C4, the 4.7 uF input RC damper on /12V_PROT via R2, is a 50 V X7R 1210 (Murata GCJ32ER71H475KA12L, LCSC C417122), rated above the 38.9 V SMCJ24A clamp."
    },
    {
      "checks": [
        "brownout-floor"
      ],
      "id": "psu-brownout-floor",
      "source": {
        "locator": "pending_requirements/psu-brownout-floor/source",
        "path": "block-contract.json"
      },
      "statement": "+3V3 stays regulated at 3.30 V until U3 (LMR16020PDDAR) reaches its 4.30 V minimum operating VIN, a guaranteed steady-state floor of about 4.80 V at the battery (4.30 V plus the ~0.50 V series path), with the LMR16020 EN UVLO falling at 4.50 V."
    },
    {
